 "con": {
  "title": "Script 6 · More than your car",
  "sub": "Selfie VSL, about 1 minute",
  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "01",
    "html": "<div class=\"strip\">Script 6 · selfie VSL, about 1 minute</div>",
    "text": "Script 6 · selfie VSL, about 1 minute"
   },
   {
    "id": "02",
    "html": "<div class=\"h1\">More than your car</div>",
    "text": "More than your car"
   },
   {
    "id": "03",
    "html": "<div class=\"spec\"><div class=\"lab\">Video</div><p class=\"p\">Vertical selfie video, filmed on a phone at arm&#x27;s length. A woman at her kitchen table on a grey autumn morning, mug of tea in front of her, talking straight to camera like she&#x27;s passing on a tip to a friend. Natural home sound, no text on screen.</p></div>",
    "text": "Video Vertical selfie video, filmed on a phone at arm's length. A woman at her kitchen table on a grey autumn morning, mug of tea in front of her, talking straight to camera like she's passing on a tip to a friend. Natural home sound, no text on screen."
   },
   {
    "id": "04",
    "html": "<div class=\"spec\"><div class=\"lab\">Characters</div><p class=\"p\"><b>Woman:</b> British, late 50s, warm and plain-spoken.</p></div>",
    "text": "Characters Woman: British, late 50s, warm and plain-spoken."
   },
   {
    "id": "05",
    "html": "<div class=\"os\"><div class=\"oslab\">On screen, first 2 seconds</div><div class=\"ostx\">Window quote more than your car?</div></div>",
    "text": "On screen, first 2 seconds Window quote more than your car?"
   },
   {
    "id": "06",
    "html": "<div class=\"sh\">Script</div>",
    "text": "Script"
   },
   {
    "id": "07",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Woman</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">If every window quote you get costs more than your car, listen to this.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Woman If every window quote you get costs more than your car, listen to this."
   },
   {
    "id": "08",
    "html": "<div class=\"line cont\"><span class=\"who\">Woman</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Most of us know the windows need doing. Draughty frames, wet glass every morning, the heating on and the house still cold.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Woman Most of us know the windows need doing. Draughty frames, wet glass every morning, the heating on and the house still cold."
   },
   {
    "id": "09",
    "html": "<div class=\"line cont\"><span class=\"who\">Woman</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Then someone quotes you eight or ten grand, and you put it off again.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Woman Then someone quotes you eight or ten grand, and you put it off again."
   },
   {
    "id": "10",
    "html": "<div class=\"line cont\"><span class=\"who\">Woman</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">What most people don&#x27;t know is you can check for funding before anyone gives you a price.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Woman What most people don't know is you can check for funding before anyone gives you a price."
   },
   {
    "id": "11",
    "html": "<div class=\"line cont\"><span class=\"who\">Woman</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">It&#x27;s paid for by window companies, proper certified installers, nothing to do with the government. It&#x27;s how they find new customers.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Woman It's paid for by window companies, proper certified installers, nothing to do with the government. It's how they find new customers."
   },
   {
    "id": "12",
    "html": "<div class=\"line cont\"><span class=\"who\">Woman</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">You pop your postcode in, answer a few questions about the house, and you get a call telling you what you can get.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Woman You pop your postcode in, answer a few questions about the house, and you get a call telling you what you can get."
   },
   {
    "id": "13",
    "html": "<div class=\"line cont\"><span class=\"who\">Woman</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Some people get the whole job covered. Most get part of it paid for, or pay nothing upfront. Either way, you know where you stand before anyone quotes you.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Woman Some people get the whole job covered. Most get part of it paid for, or pay nothing upfront. Either way, you know where you stand before anyone quotes you."
   },
   {
    "id": "14",
    "html": "<div class=\"line cont\"><span class=\"who\">Woman</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">You do need to own your home, and it depends where you live. No one comes round unless you&#x27;ve said yes.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Woman You do need to own your home, and it depends where you live. No one comes round unless you've said yes."
   },
   {
    "id": "15",
    "html": "<div class=\"line cont\"><span class=\"who\">Woman</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">So if it&#x27;s the price that&#x27;s stopping you, check first. It takes about a minute and costs nothing. I&#x27;ve put the link below.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Woman So if it's the price that's stopping you, check first. It takes about a minute and costs nothing. I've put the link below."
   },
   {
    "id": "16",
    "html": "<div class=\"os\"><div class=\"oslab\">End text</div><div class=\"ostx\">Tap the link. Pop your postcode in. Get a call with what you can get.</div></div>",
    "text": "End text Tap the link. Pop your postcode in. Get a call with what you can get."
   }
  ],
  "videos": []
 },
