 "cold2": {
  "title": "Script 9 · Why are British houses so cold",
  "sub": "Street interview, your version of Script 2",
  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "01",
    "html": "<div class=\"strip\">Script 9 · street interview, your version of Script 2</div>",
    "text": "Script 9 · street interview, your version of Script 2"
   },
   {
    "id": "02",
    "html": "<div class=\"h1\">Why are British houses so cold</div>",
    "text": "Why are British houses so cold"
   },
   {
    "id": "03",
    "html": "<div class=\"spec\"><div class=\"lab\">Video</div><p class=\"p\">A viral UK street interview, filmed handheld on a phone. Cold morning in late autumn, on a street of older houses. A presenter with a handheld mic, wrapped up in a coat, stops a window fitter by his van and asks the question straight away. Quick cuts, natural street sound, no text on screen. They both talk quickly, like a real viral street interview, with no pauses between lines.</p></div>",
    "text": "Video A viral UK street interview, filmed handheld on a phone. Cold morning in late autumn, on a street of older houses. A presenter with a handheld mic, wrapped up in a coat, stops a window fitter by his van and asks the question straight away. Quick cuts, natural street sound, no text on screen. They both talk quickly, like a real viral street interview, with no pauses between lines."
   },
   {
    "id": "04",
    "html": "<div class=\"spec\"><div class=\"lab\">Characters</div><p class=\"p\"><b>Presenter:</b> friendly, 30s, in a warm coat, holding a handheld mic. A bit sceptical, asks what a normal person would ask.</p><p class=\"p\"><b>Fitter:</b> British man in his 40s or 50s, in plain work clothes with no company logo. Calm, dry, no hard sell.</p></div>",
    "text": "Characters Presenter: friendly, 30s, in a warm coat, holding a handheld mic. A bit sceptical, asks what a normal person would ask. Fitter: British man in his 40s or 50s, in plain work clothes with no company logo. Calm, dry, no hard sell."
   },
   {
    "id": "05",
    "html": "<div class=\"sh\">Script</div>",
    "text": "Script"
   },
   {
    "id": "06",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Presenter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Why are British houses so cold?</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Presenter Why are British houses so cold?"
   },
   {
    "id": "07",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Fitter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Old windows, a lot of the time. The heat goes straight through them.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Fitter Old windows, a lot of the time. The heat goes straight through them."
   },
   {
    "id": "08",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Presenter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">So people are paying to heat the street.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Presenter So people are paying to heat the street."
   },
   {
    "id": "09",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Fitter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Pretty much. Heating on full, and they&#x27;re still sat there in a jumper.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Fitter Pretty much. Heating on full, and they're still sat there in a jumper."
   },
   {
    "id": "10",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Presenter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Why don&#x27;t they just get new ones?</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Presenter Why don't they just get new ones?"
   },
   {
    "id": "11",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Fitter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">The quotes. Someone gives you a number with a comma in it, and you think, maybe next year. Can&#x27;t blame anyone for that.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Fitter The quotes. Someone gives you a number with a comma in it, and you think, maybe next year. Can't blame anyone for that."
   },
   {
    "id": "12",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Presenter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">So what would you tell them?</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Presenter So what would you tell them?"
   },
   {
    "id": "13",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Fitter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Check for funding before you get any quotes.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Fitter Check for funding before you get any quotes."
   },
   {
    "id": "14",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Presenter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Isn&#x27;t that only if you&#x27;re on benefits?</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Presenter Isn't that only if you're on benefits?"
   },
   {
    "id": "15",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Fitter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">That&#x27;s the government stuff. There&#x27;s private funding as well. Window companies put the money up, because they want the customers.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Fitter That's the government stuff. There's private funding as well. Window companies put the money up, because they want the customers."
   },
   {
    "id": "16",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Presenter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">So it&#x27;s free?</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Presenter So it's free?"
   },
   {
    "id": "17",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Fitter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">For some people, the whole lot. If not, you&#x27;ll usually get offered finance or money off. Either way, you know where you stand before anyone quotes you.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Fitter For some people, the whole lot. If not, you'll usually get offered finance or money off. Either way, you know where you stand before anyone quotes you."
   },
   {
    "id": "18",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Presenter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Who can get it?</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Presenter Who can get it?"
   },
   {
    "id": "19",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Fitter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Homeowners. After that it depends where you live.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Fitter Homeowners. After that it depends where you live."
   },
   {
    "id": "20",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Presenter (to camera)</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">I&#x27;ve put a link below. It asks if you own your home, how many windows and doors, and why you want them done. Pop your number in and you&#x27;ll get a call telling you what you can get. No one comes round unless you want them to.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Presenter (to camera) I've put a link below. It asks if you own your home, how many windows and doors, and why you want them done. Pop your number in and you'll get a call telling you what you can get. No one comes round unless you want them to."
   }
  ],
  "videos": []
 },
