 "heating": {
  "title": "Script 10 · Best way to save on heating this winter",
  "sub": "Street interview, energy-bills version of Script 3",
  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "01",
    "html": "<div class=\"strip\">Script 10 · street interview, energy-bills version of Script 3</div>",
    "text": "Script 10 · street interview, energy-bills version of Script 3"
   },
   {
    "id": "02",
    "html": "<div class=\"h1\">Best way to save on heating this winter</div>",
    "text": "Best way to save on heating this winter"
   },
   {
    "id": "03",
    "html": "<div class=\"spec\"><div class=\"lab\">Video</div><p class=\"p\">A viral UK street interview, filmed handheld on a phone. Daytime, on a normal residential street. A presenter with a handheld mic stops a window fitter by his van and asks the question straight away. Quick cuts, natural street sound, no text on screen. They both talk quickly, like a real viral street interview, with no pauses between lines.</p></div>",
    "text": "Video A viral UK street interview, filmed handheld on a phone. Daytime, on a normal residential street. A presenter with a handheld mic stops a window fitter by his van and asks the question straight away. Quick cuts, natural street sound, no text on screen. They both talk quickly, like a real viral street interview, with no pauses between lines."
   },
   {
    "id": "04",
    "html": "<div class=\"spec\"><div class=\"lab\">Characters</div><p class=\"p\"><b>Presenter:</b> friendly, 30s, holding a handheld mic, quick and curious.</p><p class=\"p\"><b>Fitter:</b> British man in his 40s or 50s, in plain work clothes with no company logo, relaxed and matter of fact.</p></div>",
    "text": "Characters Presenter: friendly, 30s, holding a handheld mic, quick and curious. Fitter: British man in his 40s or 50s, in plain work clothes with no company logo, relaxed and matter of fact."
   },
   {
    "id": "05",
    "html": "<div class=\"os\"><div class=\"oslab\">On screen, first 2 seconds</div><div class=\"ostx\">Asked a window fitter the best way to save on heating this winter</div></div>",
    "text": "On screen, first 2 seconds Asked a window fitter the best way to save on heating this winter"
   },
   {
    "id": "06",
    "html": "<div class=\"sh\">Script</div>",
    "text": "Script"
   },
   {
    "id": "07",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Presenter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">You fit windows, yeah? What&#x27;s the best way to save on heating this winter?</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Presenter You fit windows, yeah? What's the best way to save on heating this winter?"
   },
   {
    "id": "08",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Fitter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Honestly? Sort your windows out. Old ones let the heat straight out.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Fitter Honestly? Sort your windows out. Old ones let the heat straight out."
   },
   {
    "id": "09",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Presenter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Is it really that bad?</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Presenter Is it really that bad?"
   },
   {
    "id": "10",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Fitter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Put your hand by an old frame on a cold night. You&#x27;re paying to heat the street.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Fitter Put your hand by an old frame on a cold night. You're paying to heat the street."
   },
   {
    "id": "11",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Presenter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">But new windows cost a fortune.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Presenter But new windows cost a fortune."
   },
   {
    "id": "12",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Fitter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">That&#x27;s why most people leave it. But you don&#x27;t always have to pay it all upfront.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Fitter That's why most people leave it. But you don't always have to pay it all upfront."
   },
   {
    "id": "13",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Presenter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">How do you mean?</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Presenter How do you mean?"
   },
   {
    "id": "14",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Fitter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">There&#x27;s funding from window companies, not the government. Some homeowners get grants towards it. Most spread the cost, with nothing to pay upfront.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Fitter There's funding from window companies, not the government. Some homeowners get grants towards it. Most spread the cost, with nothing to pay upfront."
   },
   {
    "id": "15",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Presenter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">And it actually brings the bills down?</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Presenter And it actually brings the bills down?"
   },
   {
    "id": "16",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Fitter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Warmer house, heating on less. And no more wet windows every morning.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Fitter Warmer house, heating on less. And no more wet windows every morning."
   },
   {
    "id": "17",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Presenter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">Who can get it?</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Presenter Who can get it?"
   },
   {
    "id": "18",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Fitter</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">You&#x27;ve got to own your home, and it depends where you live.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Fitter You've got to own your home, and it depends where you live."
   },
   {
    "id": "19",
    "html": "<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">Presenter (to camera)</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"say\">I&#x27;ve put a link below. Pop your postcode in and see what you can get. Takes a minute, costs nothing, and no one comes round unless you want them to.</span></span></div>",
    "text": "Presenter (to camera) I've put a link below. Pop your postcode in and see what you can get. Takes a minute, costs nothing, and no one comes round unless you want them to."
   },
   {
    "id": "20",
    "html": "<div class=\"os\"><div class=\"oslab\">End text</div><div class=\"ostx\">Tap the link. Pop your postcode in. See what you can get.</div></div>",
    "text": "End text Tap the link. Pop your postcode in. See what you can get."
   }
  ],
  "videos": []
 },
